<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77317/heartcrusher-wristplates">
<img alt="Heartcrusher Wristplates" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_plate_raiddeathknight_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Heartcrusher Wristplates</span></a></td>
<td>1250x <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a></td></tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: center;">9</td>
<td>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77119/bones-of-the-damned">
<img alt="Bones of the Damned" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_plate_raiddeathknight_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bones of the Damned</span></a></td>
<td>2200x <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a></td></tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: center;">10</td>
<td>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77165/grimfist-crushers">
<img alt="Grimfist Crushers" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlet_plate_raiddeathknight_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Grimfist Crushers</span></a></td>
<td>1650x <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a></td></tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: center;">11</td>
<td>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77155/visage-of-petrification">
<img alt="Visage of Petrification" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helm_plate_raiddeathknight_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Visage of Petrification</span></a></td>
<td>2200x <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>
<br/>Since tier items are no longer available to be purchased with <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a>, there is now a lot of different off-set items that fit into the slots shared by major tier items; as a result there is a ton of available items from <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> to consider this phase. Obtaining the lower-level tier sets is now done through <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=395/justice-points">
<span>
<img alt="Justice Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-justice.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Justice Points</span></span></a>, <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3148/fissure-stone-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Fissure Stone Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_talisman_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fissure Stone Fragment</span></span></a>, <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3281/obsidian-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Obsidian Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_stone_15.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Obsidian Fragment</span></span></a>, and the <b>
<span class="c9">Twilight Protocol</span></b> dungeons.<br/>
<br/>The top three purchases you should make are <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77097/dreamcrusher-drape">
<img alt="Dreamcrusher Drape" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_deathwingraid_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dreamcrusher Drape</span></a>, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77090/necklace-of-black-dragons-teeth">
<img alt="Necklace of Black Dragon's Teeth" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_bonenecklace.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Necklace of Black Dragon's Teeth</span></a>, and then <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77081/gutripper-shard">
<img alt="Gutripper Shard" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_fire_sealoffire.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Gutripper Shard</span></a>, as all three of these items are best-in-slot for this phase. The biggest upgrade for most players is likely to be <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77097/dreamcrusher-drape">
<img alt="Dreamcrusher Drape" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_deathwingraid_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dreamcrusher Drape</span></a>, as the best-in-slot cloak in the previous phase was only 372 item level, and therefore it is ranked highest as the top priority purchase. There really are not many cloak options in general, as there is no Strength DPS cloak from <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5892/dragon-soul">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Dragon Soul</span></a>, making this an even more important purchase. The other two items - <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77090/necklace-of-black-dragons-teeth">
<img alt="Necklace of Black Dragon's Teeth" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_bonenecklace.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Necklace of Black Dragon's Teeth</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77081/gutripper-shard">
<img alt="Gutripper Shard" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_fire_sealoffire.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Gutripper Shard</span></a> - are smaller upgrades over previous best-in-slot, but are still the best options that can be found this phase. <br/>
<br/>The <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77116/rotting-skull">
<img alt="Rotting Skull" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_bone_orcskull_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Rotting Skull</span></a> trinket is slightly better than the PvP trinket <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=73496/cataclysmic-gladiators-badge-of-victory">
<img alt="Cataclysmic Gladiator's Badge of Victory" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_championsbond.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cataclysmic Gladiator's Badge of Victory</span></a>, and both massive for the Spine of <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/npc=53879/deathwing">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Deathwing</span></a> encounter. <br/>
<br/>The next few items are second-best or third-best options in their respective slots - <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77185/demonbone-waistguard">
<img alt="Demonbone Waistguard" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_plate_raiddeathknight_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Demonbone Waistguard</span></a>, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77170/kneebreaker-boots">
<img alt="Kneebreaker Boots" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_plate_raiddeathknight_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Kneebreaker Boots</span></a>, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77110/ring-of-torn-flesh">
<img alt="Ring of Torn Flesh" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_ahnqiraj_06.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ring of Torn Flesh</span></a>, and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77317/heartcrusher-wristplates">
<img alt="Heartcrusher Wristplates" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_plate_raiddeathknight_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Heartcrusher Wristplates</span></a> - and these options do not occupy major tier slots where you will likely need to use tier items for their various set bonuses, therefore they are more important to pick up than the helm, gloves, or chest. <br/>
<br/>The last three items - <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77119/bones-of-the-damned">
<img alt="Bones of the Damned" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_plate_raiddeathknight_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bones of the Damned</span></a>, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77165/grimfist-crushers">
<img alt="Grimfist Crushers" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlet_plate_raiddeathknight_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Grimfist Crushers</span></a>, and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77155/visage-of-petrification">
<img alt="Visage of Petrification" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helm_plate_raiddeathknight_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Visage of Petrification</span></a> - occupy tier slots where you will likely be using tier instead, whether it's Tier 12 you are still holding onto, or Tier 13 from <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5892/dragon-soul">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Dragon Soul</span></a>; therefore, it's unlikely that you would want to purchase these anytime soon, if at all. <br/>
<br/>
