<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="learn-about-popular-gear-with-archon">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">Learn About Popular Gear With Archon</span></h3>As you gear up your character, you may not have the best gear available for every slot. <a href="https://www.archon.gg">
<img alt="" class="archon-logo-inline" src="https://assets.rpglogs.com/img/archon/logo-64.svg"/> Archon</a> compiles log data from thousands of players and shows <a href="https://www.archon.gg/classic-cata/builds/retribution/paladin/raid/gear-and-tier-set/25-heroic/all-bosses" target="_blank">the most popular builds and most popular alternatives</a>. At a glance, you can see what other players have done for different types of content.<br/>
<br/>
<a href="https://www.archon.gg/classic-cata/builds/retribution/paladin/raid/gear-and-tier-set/25-heroic/all-bosses" target="_blank">
<div class="archon-section__banner">
<div class="archon-section__banner-bg-1 lazy-load-background" style="background-image: url('https://assets.rpglogs.com/img/archon/logo-64.svg');"></div>
<div class="archon-section__banner-bg-2 lazy-load-background" style="background-image: url('https://www.archon.gg/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.rpglogs.com%2Fimg%2Fwarcraft%2Fbuilds%2Fspecs%2Fpaladin-2.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75');"></div>
<div class="archon-section__banner-content">Retribution Paladin Popular Gear on Archon
       </div></div></a>
<hr/>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="body-armor">Body Armor for Retribution Paladin DPS</h3>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="head-for-retribution-paladin-dps">Head for Retribution Paladin DPS</h4>The best pre-raid helm option is the <b>LFR</b> variant of the <b>Tier 13</b> <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78788/helmet-of-radiant-glory">
<img alt="Helmet of Radiant Glory" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helm_plate_raidpaladin_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Helmet of Radiant Glory</span></a> which is expected to be purchased using the new <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3281/obsidian-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Obsidian Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_stone_15.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Obsidian Fragment</span></span></a> currency that is earned in <b>
<span class="c9">Twilight Protocol</span></b> dungeons. The set bonuses on this set are powerful, particularly the <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=105765/item-paladin-t13-retribution-2p-bonus-judgement">2-set bonus</a> that generates 1 <a data-entity="resource" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/resource/holy-power-9">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Holy Power</span></a> when casting <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=20271/judgement">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_righteousfury.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Judgement</span></a>. <br/>
<br/>There is also the higher item level <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77155/visage-of-petrification">
<img alt="Visage of Petrification" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helm_plate_raiddeathknight_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Visage of Petrification</span></a> from <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a>, but it will be a while before you have enough <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> to purchase it, and you will likely be using tier in this slot regardless.<br/>
<br/>The next-best option is the Normal <b>Tier 12</b> <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71065/immolation-helmet">
<img alt="Immolation Helmet" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_plate_raidpaladin_j_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Immolation Helmet</span></a>, which is now be purchaseable with <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3148/fissure-stone-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Fissure Stone Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_talisman_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fissure Stone Fragment</span></span></a>, just as <b>Tier 11</b> was last phase; this is assuming you are able to benefit from a set bonus, otherwise the higher item level options will be stronger. <br/>
<br/>If you're an Engineer, you can also craft the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=59359/reinforced-bio-optic-killshades">
<img alt="Reinforced Bio-Optic Killshades" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gizmo_newgoggles.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Reinforced Bio-Optic Killshades</span></a> and make use of the powerful Cogwheel gems, as a temporary option. <br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Helm Enchant</b>: <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62422/arcanum-of-the-wildhammer">
<img alt="Arcanum of the Wildhammer" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_fire_masterofelements.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Arcanum of the Wildhammer</span></a> or <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62368/arcanum-of-the-dragonmaw">
<img alt="Arcanum of the Dragonmaw" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_fire_masterofelements.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Arcanum of the Dragonmaw</span></a>, requires Revered reputation with <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/faction=1172/dragonmaw-clan">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Dragonmaw Clan</span></a> or <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/faction=1174/wildhammer-clan">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Wildhammer Clan</span></a>
<div class="pad"></div>
<div class="wh-center" style="text-align: -webkit-center;">
<div class="markup-table-wrapper">
<table class="grid max-width">
