<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="shoulders-for-retribution-paladin-dps">Shoulders for Retribution Paladin DPS</h4>This slot will be where we place our one single non-tier off-set item - <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78470/backbreaker-spaulders">
<img alt="Backbreaker Spaulders" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_plate_raiddeathknight_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Backbreaker Spaulders</span></a> - which is the lower-level <b>LFR</b> variant of our best-in-slot shoulders, purchased with the <b>
<span class="c9">Twilight Protocol</span></b> dungeon reward currency <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3281/obsidian-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Obsidian Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_stone_15.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Obsidian Fragment</span></span></a>. <br/>
<br/>You can also use the <b>LFR</b> variant of the <b>Tier 13</b> <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78837/pauldrons-of-radiant-glory">
<img alt="Pauldrons of Radiant Glory" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_plate_raidpaladin_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Pauldrons of Radiant Glory</span></a> instead, and for your one off-piece utilize the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=73570/cataclysmic-gladiators-scaled-gauntlets">
<img alt="Cataclysmic Gladiator's Scaled Gauntlets" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_glove_plate_pvppaladin_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cataclysmic Gladiator's Scaled Gauntlets</span></a>; both setups perform about the same, though using the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78470/backbreaker-spaulders">
<img alt="Backbreaker Spaulders" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_plate_raiddeathknight_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Backbreaker Spaulders</span></a> setup has a more streamlined approach to best-in-slot. <br/>
<br/>The <b>Tier 12</b> <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71067/immolation-pauldrons">
<img alt="Immolation Pauldrons" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_plate_raidpaladin_j_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Immolation Pauldrons</span></a> shoulders still hold up quite well, if using them in order to obtain the incredible <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=99116/item-paladin-t12-retribution-4p-bonus">4-set bonus</a>. These should be purchaseable with <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3148/fissure-stone-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Fissure Stone Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_talisman_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fissure Stone Fragment</span></span></a>, just like <b>Tier 11</b> last phase. <br/>
<br/>Other than those listed above, your only other decent option is to grab the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=72821/temporal-pauldrons">
<img alt="Temporal Pauldrons" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_plate_dungeonplate_c_06.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Temporal Pauldrons</span></a> from the new <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5789/end-time">
<span class="tinyicontxt">End Time</span></a> dungeon. <br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Shoulder Enchant</b>: <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62345/greater-inscription-of-jagged-stone">
<img alt="Greater Inscription of Jagged Stone" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_gem_emeraldrough_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Greater Inscription of Jagged Stone</span></a>, requires Exalted reputation with <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/faction=1171/therazane">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Therazane</span></a>
