<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="back-for-retribution-paladin-dps">Back for Retribution Paladin DPS</h4>The highest priority item to purchase with your <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> currency is <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77097/dreamcrusher-drape">
<img alt="Dreamcrusher Drape" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_deathwingraid_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dreamcrusher Drape</span></a>, as this cloak is a large upgrade over previous best-in-slot and any other pre-raid cloaks, but also because it is best-in-slot for the rest of the expansion, so you will never replace it. There are not many options, as there are no Strength DPS cloaks in <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5892/dragon-soul">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Dragon Soul</span></a>, and therefore no <b>LFR</b> variant options. <br/>
<br/>Another easily-obtainable option is <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=72838/cloak-of-the-royal-protector">
<img alt="Cloak of the Royal Protector" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_cape_430dungeon_c_04.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cloak of the Royal Protector</span></a> from the new <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5788/well-of-eternity">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Well of Eternity</span></a> dungeon. Additionally you could purchase one of the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69879/cloudburst-cloak">
<img alt="Cloudburst Cloak" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_cataclysm_tank_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cloudburst Cloak</span></a> with <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3148/fissure-stone-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Fissure Stone Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_talisman_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fissure Stone Fragment</span></span></a>, but this is probably a waste of currency at this time, as you will be buying the <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> cloak immediately. <br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Back Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=75178/swordguard-embroidery">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_thread_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Swordguard Embroidery</span></a> for Tailors, otherwise <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74247/enchant-cloak-greater-critical-strike">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulagood_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Cloak - Greater Critical Strike</span></a>
