<br/>
<i>55x <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3281/obsidian-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Obsidian Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_stone_15.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Obsidian Fragment</span></span></a></i></td>
<td>
<a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=1519/stormwind-city">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Stormwind City</span></a>, <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=1637/orgrimmar">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Orgrimmar</span></a>
<br/>
<b>
<span class="c9">Twilight Protocol</span></b> dungeons</td></tr>
<tr>
<td>Very Good</td>
