<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="gloves-for-retribution-paladin-dps">Gloves for Retribution Paladin DPS</h4>As is likely obvious by now, we will aim for the <b>LFR</b> variant of our best-in-slot gloves - <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78770/gauntlets-of-radiant-glory">
<img alt="Gauntlets of Radiant Glory" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlet_plate_raidpaladin_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Gauntlets of Radiant Glory</span></a> - by completing <b>
<span class="c9">Twilight Protocol</span></b> dungeons. <br/>
<br/>You can also use the PvP gloves <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=73570/cataclysmic-gladiators-scaled-gauntlets">
<img alt="Cataclysmic Gladiator's Scaled Gauntlets" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_glove_plate_pvppaladin_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cataclysmic Gladiator's Scaled Gauntlets</span></a> instead as your one non-tier off-piece item, and instead use the <b>LFR</b> variant of <b>Tier 13</b> <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78837/pauldrons-of-radiant-glory">
<img alt="Pauldrons of Radiant Glory" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_plate_raidpaladin_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Pauldrons of Radiant Glory</span></a> in the shoulder slot. Both setups perform about the same, though using the PvP gloves has a less streamlined approach to best-in-slot gear. <br/>
<br/>There is also the higher-item-level <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77165/grimfist-crushers">
<img alt="Grimfist Crushers" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlet_plate_raiddeathknight_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Grimfist Crushers</span></a>, though this is a major tier slot where we will often be using tier instead for a set bonus, and as a result we won't place a high priority on buying these gloves with our hard-earned <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a>, at least until a number of weeks down the road when we have more to spare. <br/>
<br/>The next best glove slot option pre-raid is <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71064/immolation-gauntlets">
<img alt="Immolation Gauntlets" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_plate_raidpaladin_j_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Immolation Gauntlets</span></a> for the <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=99116/item-paladin-t12-retribution-4p-bonus">4-set bonus</a>. <br/>
<br/>Additionally you can also have a Blacksmith craft you a pair of the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69936/fists-of-fury">
<img alt="Fists of Fury" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_glove_plate_raidwarrior_j_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fists of Fury</span></a>. <br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Gloves Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74254/enchant-gloves-mighty-strength">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulagood_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Gloves - Mighty Strength</span></a> plus <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=82175/synapse-springs">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Synapse Springs</span></a> (<i>Engineers only</i>)<div class="pad"></div>
