<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="waist-for-retribution-paladin-dps">Waist for Retribution Paladin DPS</h4>The best belt is <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77185/demonbone-waistguard">
<img alt="Demonbone Waistguard" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_plate_raiddeathknight_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Demonbone Waistguard</span></a>, but we won't have the <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> to spare on this for a few weeks, as it's not best-in-slot. <br/>
<br/>Instead the pre-raid set has <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78888/waistguard-of-bleeding-bone">
<img alt="Waistguard of Bleeding Bone" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_plate_raidwarrior_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Waistguard of Bleeding Bone</span></a> listed as it can be bought from the auction house, saving us valuable <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a>. <br/>
<br/>The <b>LFR</b> variant of <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78424/runescriven-demon-collar">
<img alt="Runescriven Demon Collar" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_plate_raiddeathknight_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Runescriven Demon Collar</span></a> is also available from <b>
<span class="c9">Twilight Protocol</span></b> dungeons, until you pick up one of the above belts. <br/>
<br/>There is also a solid belt <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=72832/girdle-of-the-queens-champion">
<img alt="Girdle of the Queen's Champion" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_plate_dungeonplate_c_06.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Girdle of the Queen's Champion</span></a> from the new dungeon <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5788/well-of-eternity">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Well of Eternity</span></a>. <br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Waist Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=55016/nitro-boosts">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Nitro Boosts</span></a> and <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=55054/ebonsteel-belt-buckle">
<img alt="Ebonsteel Belt Buckle" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_83.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ebonsteel Belt Buckle</span></a>
