<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="legs-for-retribution-paladin-dps">Legs for Retribution Paladin DPS</h4>Here we will need to pick up the <b>LFR</b> variant of our <b>Tier 13</b> <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78807/legplates-of-radiant-glory">
<img alt="Legplates of Radiant Glory" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_plate_raidpaladin_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Legplates of Radiant Glory</span></a> from <b>
<span class="c9">Twilight Protocol</span></b> dungeons in order to complete our set bonuses. <br/>
<br/>There is also a great pair of crafted legs - <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71983/unstoppable-destroyers-legplates">
<img alt="Unstoppable Destroyer's Legplates" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_plate_raiddeathknight_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Unstoppable Destroyer's Legplates</span></a> - that make a great off-set piece if you have four pieces of tier in other slots. <br/>
<br/>The <b>Tier 12</b> <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71066/immolation-legplates">
<img alt="Immolation Legplates" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_plate_raidpaladin_j_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Immolation Legplates</span></a> can now be purchased with <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=395/justice-points">
<span>
<img alt="Justice Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-justice.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Justice Points</span></span></a>, though you should aim for higher level items unless you can complete a set bonus.<br/>
<br/>You can also spend a few <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3148/fissure-stone-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Fissure Stone Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_talisman_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fissure Stone Fragment</span></span></a> to get a pair of the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=65379/sky-strider-greaves">
<img alt="Sky Strider Greaves" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_plate_raiddeathknight_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sky Strider Greaves</span></a>, but these are now easily replaced. <br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Legs Enchant</b>: <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56550/dragonscale-leg-armor">
<img alt="Dragonscale Leg Armor" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_monsterscales_14.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dragonscale Leg Armor</span></a>
