<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="boots-for-retribution-paladin-dps">Boots for Retribution Paladin DPS</h4>The best single pair of boots pre-raid are the <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> option, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77170/kneebreaker-boots">
<img alt="Kneebreaker Boots" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_plate_raiddeathknight_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Kneebreaker Boots</span></a>; though, we won't have the currency to spare for at least a few weeks as these are not best-in-slot - they are bind-on-equip however, so you can actually buy these from the auction house or another player to save yourself some <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a>. <br/>
<br/>A much more realistic option would be the <b>LFR</b> variant of the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78396/treads-of-crushed-flesh">
<img alt="Treads of Crushed Flesh" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_plate_raiddeathknight_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Treads of Crushed Flesh</span></a> from <b>
<span class="c9">Twilight Protocol</span></b> dungeons, or the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=72881/treads-of-the-past">
<img alt="Treads of the Past" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_plate_dungeonplate_c_06.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Treads of the Past</span></a>; these are from the new <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5788/well-of-eternity">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Well of Eternity</span></a> dungeon. <br/>
<br/>Additionally, you could craft the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69946/warboots-of-mighty-lords">
<img alt="Warboots of Mighty Lords" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_plate_raidwarrior_j_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Warboots of Mighty Lords</span></a> boots with the aid of a Blacksmith, if you have the coin. <br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Boot Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74238/enchant-boots-mastery">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Boots - Mastery</span></a>
