<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="jewelry">Jewelry for Retribution Paladin DPS</h3>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="neck-for-retribution-paladin-dps">Neck for Retribution Paladin DPS</h4>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77090/necklace-of-black-dragons-teeth">
<img alt="Necklace of Black Dragon's Teeth" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_bonenecklace.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Necklace of Black Dragon's Teeth</span></a> is the obvious choice here, and is one of our most important <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> purchases, as it is best-in-slot for the rest of the expansion. <br/>
<br/>If you are short on <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a>, you can buy the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71212/stoneheart-choker">
<img alt="Stoneheart Choker" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_necklace_firelands_1.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Stoneheart Choker</span></a> using <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=395/justice-points">
<span>
<img alt="Justice Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-justice.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Justice Points</span></span></a>, or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=65025/rage-of-ages">
<img alt="Rage of Ages" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_necklacea8.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Rage of Ages</span></a> using a few <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3148/fissure-stone-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Fissure Stone Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_talisman_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fissure Stone Fragment</span></span></a>, or even save some <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3148/fissure-stone-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Fissure Stone Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_talisman_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fissure Stone Fragment</span></span></a> by going for the weaker <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69885/cloudburst-necklace">
<img alt="Cloudburst Necklace" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_necklacea3.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cloudburst Necklace</span></a>.<div class="pad"></div>
<div class="wh-center" style="text-align: -webkit-center;">
<div class="markup-table-wrapper">
