<b>Location</b></td></tr>
<tr>
<td>Best</td>
<td>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77090/necklace-of-black-dragons-teeth">
<img alt="Necklace of Black Dragon's Teeth" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_bonenecklace.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Necklace of Black Dragon's Teeth</span></a></td>
<td></td>
