<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="rings-for-retribution-paladin-dps">Rings for Retribution Paladin DPS</h4>The best pre-raid ring is, once again, a <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> purchase that we cannot really afford for a few weeks until the cap is higher - <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77110/ring-of-torn-flesh">
<img alt="Ring of Torn Flesh" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_ahnqiraj_06.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ring of Torn Flesh</span></a> - and for that reason, the set at the top of the guide has the <b>LFR</b> variant rings listed instead - <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78440/curled-twilight-claw">
<img alt="Curled Twilight Claw" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_24.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Curled Twilight Claw</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78497/breathstealer-band">
<img alt="Breathstealer Band" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_97.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Breathstealer Band</span></a> - which are obtained by completing <b>
<span class="c9">Twilight Protocol</span></b> dungeons.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=72886/thralls-gratitude">
<img alt="Thrall's Gratitude" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_ring_generic_4.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Thrall's Gratitude</span></a> is a great early ring option, which is a reward from a <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5844/hour-of-twilight">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Hour of Twilight</span></a> quest.<br/>
<br/>The next best ring option would be <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60226/dargonaxs-signet">
<img alt="Dargonax's Signet" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_rubystar.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dargonax's Signet</span></a> which you can purchase with <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3148/fissure-stone-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Fissure Stone Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_talisman_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fissure Stone Fragment</span></span></a>. <br/>
<br/>Additionally, you can now purchase <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71208/serrated-brimstone-signet">
<img alt="Serrated Brimstone Signet" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_firelandsraid_02a.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Serrated Brimstone Signet</span></a> with <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=395/justice-points">
<span>
<img alt="Justice Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-justice.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Justice Points</span></span></a>. <br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Ring Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74215/enchant-ring-strength">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Ring - Strength</span></a> (<i>enchanters only</i>)<div class="pad"></div>
