<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="trinkets-for-retribution-paladin-dps">Trinkets for Retribution Paladin DPS</h4>The best passive trinket is the <b>LFR</b> variant of <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77977/eye-of-unmaking">
<img alt="Eye of Unmaking" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_shadow_soulgem.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Eye of Unmaking</span></a>, obtained inside the <b>
<span class="c9">Twilight Protocol</span></b> difficulty <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5004/throne-of-the-tides">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Throne of the Tides</span></a> dungeon.<br/>
<br/>The best active trinket pre-raid is <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77116/rotting-skull">
<img alt="Rotting Skull" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_bone_orcskull_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Rotting Skull</span></a>, though this costs <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> and will not be our first purchase. The second-best active trinket is the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=73496/cataclysmic-gladiators-badge-of-victory">
<img alt="Cataclysmic Gladiator's Badge of Victory" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_championsbond.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cataclysmic Gladiator's Badge of Victory</span></a> which is only slightly worse and can be earned by spending half an hour in the Arena to earn some <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=390/conquest-points">
<span>
<img alt="Conquest Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvpcurrency-conquest-horde.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Conquest Points</span></span></a>. Both are massive for the Spine of <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/npc=53879/deathwing">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Deathwing</span></a> encounter over lower-level options. <br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77982/bone-link-fetish">
<img alt="Bone-Link Fetish" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_coin_12.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bone-Link Fetish</span></a> is a solid trinket for AoE encounters and trash packs, with a chance to AoE surrounding enemies. <br/>
<br/>The Heroic <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69113/apparatus-of-khazgoroth">
<img alt="Apparatus of Khaz'goroth" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_enggizmos_20.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Apparatus of Khaz'goroth</span></a> is a fantastic trinket if you use it properly and ensure that you get a Mastery proc. You can obtain this trinket outside of raid by purchasing the bind-on-equip Normal version from the auction house, and then by obtaining a <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71617/crystallized-firestone">
<img alt="Crystallized Firestone" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_diablostone.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Crystallized Firestone</span></a> from <b>
<span class="c9">Twilight Protocol</span></b> dungeons.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=72899/varothens-brooch">
<img alt="Varo'then's Brooch" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_relics_warpring.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Varo'then's Brooch</span></a>, the Normal version of <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=68972/apparatus-of-khazgoroth">
<img alt="Apparatus of Khaz'goroth" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_enggizmos_20.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Apparatus of Khaz'goroth</span></a>, and the <b>LFR</b> variant of <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77972/creche-of-the-final-dragon">
<img alt="Creche of the Final Dragon" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/creatureportrait_twilightshammer_dragonegg_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Creche of the Final Dragon</span></a> are all three similar-performing trinkets, depending on your gear setup. <br/>
<br/>The Normal version of <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=68972/apparatus-of-khazgoroth">
<img alt="Apparatus of Khaz'goroth" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_enggizmos_20.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Apparatus of Khaz'goroth</span></a>, which is BoE and can be purchased on the auction house, still holds up decently well as a pre-raid trinket and can be upgraded into the still-relevant Heroic version if you end up raiding <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5723/firelands">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Firelands</span></a>. <br/>
<br/>There is also a passive PvP trinket - <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=73491/cataclysmic-gladiators-insignia-of-victory">
<img alt="Cataclysmic Gladiator's Insignia of Victory" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_token_argentdawn3.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cataclysmic Gladiator's Insignia of Victory</span></a> - though this is much less powerful than the active on-use PvP trinket, or the trinket from <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5788/well-of-eternity">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Well of Eternity</span></a>.<div class="pad"></div>
<div class="wh-center" style="text-align: -webkit-center;">
